# NOTICE

This software implements parts of the ACMG/AMP 2015 variant interpretation framework
(Richards et al., *Genet Med* 17:405-424).

It retrieves data from ClinVar, gnomAD, Ensembl VEP and PubMed. It is **not affiliated
with or endorsed by** NCBI, the Broad Institute, Ensembl, or any of those projects.
Data remains subject to each source's own terms of use.

**Output is research evidence assembly, not a clinical classification.** It must not be
used for patient care without review by a qualified clinical genetics professional.
